<title>USA: ASV to trade on Nasdaq National Market.</title>
<headline>ASV to trade on Nasdaq National Market.</headline>
<dateline>GRAND RAPIDS, Minn. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>ASV Inc said Tuesday its common stock will begin trading on the Nasdaq National Market on Wednesday under its current symbol ASVI.</p>
<p>The company said its common shares currently trade on the Nasdaq SmallCap Market.</p>
<p>ASV, which went public in August of 1994, designs and manufactures track-driven, all-season vehicles and related accessories.</p>
<p>The company's shares were up 1/8 Tuesday afternoon at 23-7/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
